---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Enterprise DPP Software License | On-Premise & Private Cloud | EU DPP Provider"
  description="Procure independent Enterprise DPP software licensing for complete data sovereignty, custom ERP/MES/BMS integrations, and unlimited battery serialization."
>
  <div class="py-24 md:py-32 bg-stone-50">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 sm:px-8 lg:px-12">
      
      <div class="max-w-3xl">
        <span class="text-xs font-mono font-medium text-stone-600 uppercase tracking-widest bg-stone-100 px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-full border border-stone-200">
          Independent Software License
        </span>
        <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-6xl font-semibold text-stone-900 tracking-tight mt-6 mb-6">
          Enterprise DPP Software Suite: 100% Data Sovereignty
        </h1>
        <p class="text-lg sm:text-xl text-stone-500 leading-relaxed font-normal">
          Designed for tier-1 cell manufacturers, gigafactories, and automotive groups requiring on-premise or dedicated private cloud Kubernetes cluster deployment. Own your software stack, maintain absolute control over proprietary trade secrets, and scale with zero per-passport metering penalties.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Comparison Grid -->
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 my-20">
        
        <div class="bg-white p-8 sm:p-12 rounded-3xl border border-stone-200 shadow-soft space-y-4">
          <div class="text-xs font-mono font-bold text-stone-900">DEPLOYMENT ARCHITECTURE</div>
          <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-stone-900">Private Cloud & On-Premise Kubernetes</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-stone-500 leading-relaxed font-normal">
            Deploy via Helm Charts or Terraform across AWS, Azure, Google Cloud, Alibaba Cloud, or on-premise air-gapped bare metal.
          </p>
          <ul class="space-y-2.5 text-xs text-stone-700 pt-4 border-t border-stone-100 font-normal">
            <li class="flex items-center gap-2">✓ Full physical data isolation (No multi-tenant mixing)</li>
            <li class="flex items-center gap-2">✓ Open REST API & GraphQL endpoints for internal ERP</li>
            <li class="flex items-center gap-2">✓ Compatible with Catena-X Eclipse Dataspace Connector (EDC)</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-white p-8 sm:p-12 rounded-3xl border border-stone-200 shadow-soft space-y-4">
          <div class="text-xs font-mono font-bold text-emerald-800">UNLIMITED SERIALIZATION</div>
          <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-stone-900">Zero Per-Passport Overages</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-stone-500 leading-relaxed font-normal">
            Generate and manage millions of battery passports per year without variable per-unit SaaS taxes. Ideal for high-throughput Giga-scale production lines.
          </p>
          <ul class="space-y-2.5 text-xs text-stone-700 pt-4 border-t border-stone-100 font-normal">
            <li class="flex items-center gap-2">✓ High-speed batch GS1 QR code generation (120+ packs/min)</li>
            <li class="flex items-center gap-2">✓ Automated PEFCR LCA Carbon Footprint computation module</li>
            <li class="flex items-center gap-2">✓ Dedicated technical support and annual upgrade SLA</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

      </div>

      <!-- Architecture Checklist -->
      <div class="p-8 sm:p-12 rounded-3xl bg-white border border-stone-200 shadow-soft space-y-6">
        <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-stone-900">Enterprise Software Capabilities Checklist</h3>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-6 text-xs pt-2">
          <div class="p-6 bg-stone-50 rounded-2xl border border-stone-200">
            <div class="font-bold text-stone-900 text-sm mb-2">PCF Carbon Calculator</div>
            <p class="text-stone-500 leading-relaxed font-normal">Pre-built Ecoinvent & GaBi database mapping for instant cradle-to-gate battery carbon accounting.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="p-6 bg-stone-50 rounded-2xl border border-stone-200">
            <div class="font-bold text-stone-900 text-sm mb-2">Due Diligence Vault</div>
            <p class="text-stone-500 leading-relaxed font-normal">OECD 5-step framework management for Cobalt, Lithium, Nickel, and Graphite provenance audits.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="p-6 bg-stone-50 rounded-2xl border border-stone-200">
            <div class="font-bold text-stone-900 text-sm mb-2">GS1 Resolver Server</div>
            <p class="text-stone-500 leading-relaxed font-normal">Internal URI redirection server returning JSON-LD to machines and responsive HTML to consumers.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- CTA -->
      <div class="mt-20 text-center space-y-4">
        <h3 class="text-3xl font-semibold text-stone-900">Request Software Trial & Architecture Whitepaper</h3>
        <a href="/contact" class="inline-flex px-8 py-4 rounded-xl bg-stone-900 text-white font-medium text-base hover:bg-stone-800 transition-colors shadow-soft">
          Request Enterprise Software License &rarr;
        </a>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
